      "created_at": "2025-07-14T14:23:52.594Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Our current ERPNext instance version is  v15.33.5 and the latest released version is 15.69.2, is it ok to update directly to the latest version or should we do it incrementally (if possible).<br>\nWe don’t want anything to break.<br>\nsame for Frappe framework which is on version 15.39.0</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/2/b2277e0a79c10039bc56f913ad342256d4d30b1c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b2277e0a79c10039bc56f913ad342256d4d30b1c\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-07-14 181843\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/2/b2277e0a79c10039bc56f913ad342256d4d30b1c_2_530x500.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-07-14 181843\" data-base62-sha1=\"pq1BiWSStmLlaCpcWvjxATVIWL2\" width=\"530\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/2/b2277e0a79c10039bc56f913ad342256d4d30b1c_2_530x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/2/b2277e0a79c10039bc56f913ad342256d4d30b1c_2_795x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/2/b2277e0a79c10039bc56f913ad342256d4d30b1c_2_1060x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-07-14 181843</span><span class=\"informations\">1157×1091 74.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
